    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/4ae03a3bca751d31a6018a494345b3d6.poster.avif?t=1747141705\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/4ae03a3bca751d31a6018a494345b3d6.webm?t=1747141705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/4ae03a3bca751d31a6018a494345b3d6.mp4?t=1747141705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shoot your way thru traffic to rack up points and beat the clock...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/c694686927046ca5281023c4518b3132.poster.avif?t=1747141705\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/c694686927046ca5281023c4518b3132.webm?t=1747141705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/c694686927046ca5281023c4518b3132.mp4?t=1747141705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grab powerups along the way to add time, boost score, collect special weapons, and much more...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537850/extras/1703e21c36620f44b457a2038eeedc48.poster.avif?t=1747141705\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it